msgid "Map replay"
msgstr "Ripetizzjoni tal-mappa"

msgid "The map is zoomed out to show its full extent. Ownership and city locations update as the turns play."
msgstr "Il-mappa titnaqqas biex turi l-firxa sħiħa tagħha. Is-sjieda u l-postijiet tal-belt jaġġornaw hekk kif jilagħbu d-dawriet."

msgid "Start replay"
msgstr "Ibda r-ripetizzjoni"

msgid "Return to game"
msgstr "Erġa' lura għal-logħba"

msgid "Turn %d of %d"
msgstr "Dawra %d minn %d"

msgid "Close replay"
msgstr "Agħlaq ir-ripetizzjoni"

msgid "Turn %d / %d"
msgstr "Dawra %d / %d"

msgid "Saved on this PC between sessions"
msgstr "Issejvjat fuq dan il-PC bejn is-sessjonijiet"

msgid "Move the table..."
msgstr "Ċaqlaq il-mejda..."

msgid "Back to the middle"
msgstr "Lura għan-nofs"

msgid "Your controllers"
msgstr "Il-kontrolluri tiegħek"

msgid "Show button labels"
msgstr "Uri t-tikketti tal-buttuni"

msgid "Floating labels beside each controller saying what its buttons do right now."
msgstr "Tikketti f'wiċċ l-ilma ħdejn kull kontrollur li jgħidu x'jagħmlu l-buttuni tiegħu bħalissa."

msgid "The right trigger clicks when you let go of it, so holding it to zoom doesn't click anything."
msgstr "Il-grillu t-tajjeb jikklikkja meta tħallih, għalhekk iżżommha biex iżumja ma tikklikkja xejn."

msgid "Look"
msgstr "Dehra"

msgid "Gameplay"
msgstr "Logħob"

msgid "Automation"
msgstr "Awtomazzjoni"

msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Ħsejjes"

msgid "Panels"
msgstr "Panewijiet"

msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Kontrolli"

msgid "Game and saves"
msgstr "Logħba u salvati"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Fuqna"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Issettjar"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Agħlaq"

msgid "Around the table"
msgstr "Madwar il-mejda"

msgid "Backgrounds and tables are folders anyone can add: see backgrounds/README.md and tables/README.md."
msgstr "L-isfond u t-tabelli huma folders li kulħadd jista’ jżid: ara backgrounds/README.md u tables/README.md."

msgid "Background"
msgstr "Sfond"

msgid "The world around the table: sky, light and scenery."
msgstr "Id-dinja madwar il-mejda: sema, dawl u xenarju."

msgid "Table"
msgstr "Mejda"

msgid "What the map lies on. In VR its column stretches to the height you set."
msgstr "Fuq liema tinsab il-mappa. Fil-VR il-kolonna tagħha tinfirex sal-għoli li ssettja."

msgid "Where the table stands"
msgstr "Fejn tinsab il-mejda"

msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. Remembered for this background."
msgstr "Mexxi l-mejda kullimkien fix-xenarju tal-isfond - handy f'dawk kbar bħal mappa konvertita. Imfakkar għal dan l-isfond."

msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "Mexxi l-mejda kullimkien fix-xenarju tal-isfond - handy f'dawk kbar bħal mappa konvertita. Ġie mċaqlaq hawn; Lura għan-nofs tpoġġiha fejn l-isfond jibda."

msgid "Remembered for this background."
msgstr "Imfakkar għal dan l-isfond."

msgid "It's been moved here; Back to the middle puts it where the background starts it."
msgstr "Ġie mċaqlaq hawn; Lura għan-nofs tpoġġiha fejn l-isfond jibda."

msgid "The map"
msgstr "Il-mappa"

msgid "Tiles"
msgstr "Madumiet"

msgid "How terrain, wonders, resources and improvements look. Tilesets work like Unciv's: see tilesets/README.md."
msgstr "Kif jidher it-terren, il-wonders, ir-riżorsi u t-titjib. Tilesets jaħdmu bħal Unciv's: ara tilesets/README.md."

msgid "Plain coloured hexes"
msgstr "Hexes ikkuluriti sempliċi"

msgid "Flat hexes in Unciv's terrain colours, no models."
msgstr "Hexes ċatti bil-kuluri tat-terren ta 'Unciv, l-ebda mudelli."

msgid "Units"
msgstr "Unitajiet"

msgid "Same as the tiles"
msgstr "L-istess bħall-madum"

msgid "The unit models that come with the tileset above (the tiles' fallback set fills any gaps)."
msgstr "Il-mudelli tal-unità li jiġu mal-tileset hawn fuq (is-sett fallback tal-madum jimla kwalunkwe vojt)."

msgid "No models"
msgstr "Ebda mudelli"

msgid "Round tokens with Unciv's unit icons."
msgstr "Tokens tondi bl-ikoni tal-unità tal-Unciv."

msgid "How units look (Unciv's Unitset): any tileset with unit models (pieces/Units) can supply them."
msgstr "Kif jidhru l-unitajiet (Unciv's Unitset): kwalunkwe tileset b'mudelli ta 'unità (pieces/Units) jista' jfornihom."

msgid "Visual hints"
msgstr "Ħjiel viżwali"

msgid "Unciv's map overlays; the round buttons beside the overview turn them on and off too."
msgstr "Overlays tal-mapep tal-Unciv; il-buttuni tondi ħdejn il-ħarsa ġenerali jixgħelhom u jitfihom ukoll."

msgid "Show unit movement arrows"
msgstr "Uri l-vleġġeġ tal-movimenti tal-unità"

msgid "Where units have just moved and who attacked whom."
msgstr "Fejn l-unitajiet għadhom kemm mxew u min attakka lil min."

msgid "Show tile yields"
msgstr "Uri l-ħsad tal-madumiet"

msgid "Food, production, gold... on every tile."
msgstr "Ikel, produzzjoni, deheb... fuq kull maduma."

msgid "Show worked tiles"
msgstr "Uri madumiet mħaddma"

msgid "Which tiles your cities' citizens work."
msgstr "Liema madum jaħdmu ċ-ċittadini tal-bliet tiegħek."

msgid "Show resources and improvements"
msgstr "Uri riżorsi u titjiba"

msgid "Resource and improvement symbols on the tiles."
msgstr "Riżorsi u simboli ta 'titjib fuq il-madum."

msgid "Show improvement pictures"
msgstr "Uri stampi ta 'titjib"

msgid "Farms, mines, roads and the like as models."
msgstr "Irziezet, minjieri, toroq u simili bħala mudelli."

msgid "Show unit icons"
msgstr "Uri ikoni tal-unità"

msgid "The small Unciv icon above each unit model."
msgstr "L-ikona Unciv żgħira fuq kull mudell ta' unità."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Lingwa"

msgid "Unciv's own translations, by Unciv's translators: the game's messages, names and descriptions. Our own menus are still in English."
msgstr "Traduzzjonijiet ta' Unciv stess, mit-tradutturi ta' Unciv: messaġġi, ismijiet u deskrizzjonijiet tal-logħba. Il-menus tagħna stess għadhom bl-Ingliż."

msgid "Text Unciv has no translation for stays in English."
msgstr "Test Unciv m'għandha l-ebda traduzzjoni għal soġġorni bl-Ingliż."

msgid "Turns"
msgstr "Dawriet"

msgid "Check for idle units"
msgstr "Iċċekkja għal unitajiet wieqfa"

msgid "End turn first takes you to every unit that still has no orders."
msgstr "End turn l-ewwel tieħdok għal kull unità li għad m'għandhiex ordnijiet."

msgid "Auto unit cycle"
msgstr "Agħżel l-unità li jmiss awtomatikament"

msgid "After you give a unit its orders, the next unit waiting for orders is selected."
msgstr "Wara li tagħti unità l-ordnijiet tagħha, tintgħażel l-unità li jmiss li qed tistenna l-ordnijiet."

msgid "Cycle idle units by distance"
msgstr "Ċiklu unitajiet idle skond id-distanza"

msgid "Next / previous unit go to the nearest unit rather than in a fixed order."
msgstr "L-unità li jmiss/qabel mur fl-eqreb unità aktar milli f'ordni fissa."

msgid "Ask for confirmation when ending the turn"
msgstr "Itlob konferma meta tispiċċa d-dawran"

msgid "End turn needs a second press."
msgstr "End turn jeħtieġ it-tieni pressa."

msgid "Order trade offers by amount"
msgstr "Ordina l-offerti skont l-ammonti"

msgid "On the trade table, the biggest offers come first."
msgstr "Fuq il-mejda tal-kummerċ, l-akbar offerti jiġu l-ewwel."

msgid "Show suggested city locations"
msgstr "Uri l-postijiet tal-belt suġġeriti"

msgid "With a settler selected, Unciv's three best spots nearby for a new city are marked on the map."
msgstr "B'settler magħżul, l-aħjar tliet postijiet ta' Unciv fil-qrib għal belt ġdida huma mmarkati fuq il-mappa."

msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "Tutorjali"

msgid "Show tutorials"
msgstr "Uri t-tutorjali"

msgid "The tutorial messages and the task card. Every tutorial is in the Civilopedia too."
msgstr "Il-messaġġi tutorja u l-karta tal-ħidma. Kull tutorja tinsab fiċ-Ċivilopedija wkoll."

msgid "Reset tutorials"
msgstr "Irrisettja t-tutorjali"

msgid "Show every tutorial and task again, as if you were new."
msgstr "Uri kull tutorja u kompitu mill-ġdid, bħallikieku kont ġdid."

msgid "Other players"
msgstr "Plejers oħra"

msgid "Other players' turns"
msgstr "Dawriet ta’ plejers oħra"

msgid "What you see of the other players' turns after you end yours."
msgstr "Dak li tara mid-dawriet tal-plejers l-oħra wara li tispiċċa tiegħek."

msgid "Show the moves and battles I can see"
msgstr "Uri l-mossa u l-battalji li nista' nara"

msgid "Played back in order; the view glides to fights."
msgstr "Lagħbu lura fl-ordni; il-veduta glides għall-ġlied."

msgid "Show them, fast"
msgstr "Urihom, malajr"

msgid "The same, at two and a half times the speed."
msgstr "L-istess, b'darbtejn u nofs il-veloċità."

msgid "Don't show them"
msgstr "Ma juruhomx"

msgid "The map just updates."
msgstr "Il-mappa biss taġġorna."

msgid "Unciv's own options for automated units and cities."
msgstr "L-għażliet tal-Unciv stess għal unitajiet u bliet awtomatizzati."

msgid "Automated and exploring units move"
msgstr "L-unitajiet awtomatizzati u li jesploraw jimxu"

msgid "When units on automation, exploring or on multi-turn moves take their steps."
msgstr "Meta l-unitajiet fuq l-awtomazzjoni, l-esplorazzjoni jew fuq movimenti b'ħafna dawriet jieħdu l-passi tagħhom."

msgid "When I end my turn"
msgstr "Meta nispiċċa min-naħa tiegħi"

msgid "Explorers, automated workers and units on long moves go as you end the turn."
msgstr "Esploraturi, ħaddiema awtomatizzati u unitajiet fuq movimenti twal imorru hekk kif tispiċċa d-dawra."

msgid "At the start of my turn"
msgstr "Fil-bidu ta’ min-naħa tiegħi"

msgid "They go as your turn starts (Unciv's \"Automated units move on turn start\")."
msgstr "Huma jmorru hekk kif jibda min-naħa tiegħek (Unciv's \"L-unitajiet awtomatizzati jimxu fuq il-bidu tad-dawran\")."

msgid "Auto-assign city production"
msgstr "Assenja produzzjoni tal-belt awtomatikament"

msgid "A city that finishes building something picks what to build next itself."
msgstr "Belt li tispiċċa tibni xi ħaġa tagħżel dak li tibni wara hi stess."

msgid "Auto-build roads"
msgstr "Ibni toroq awtomatikament"

msgid "Automated workers build roads between your cities."
msgstr "Ħaddiema awtomatizzati jibnu toroq bejn l-ibliet tiegħek."

msgid "Automated workers replace improvements"
msgstr "Ħaddiema awtomatizzati jneħħu titjiba jekk diġà hemm waħda"

msgid "Automated workers may swap an improvement for a better one."
msgstr "Ħaddiema awtomatizzati jistgħu jibdlu titjib għal wieħed aħjar."

msgid "Stop automated workers from removing vegetation"
msgstr "Twaqqaf lill-ħaddiema awtomatizzati milli jneħħu l-veġetazzjoni"

msgid "Automated workers leave forests, jungles and marshes alone."
msgstr "Ħaddiema awtomatizzati jħallu l-foresti, il-ġungla u l-bassasijiet waħedhom."

msgid "Automated units can upgrade"
msgstr "Unitajiet awtomatizzati jistgħu jaġġornaw"

msgid "Automated military units upgrade themselves when you can afford it."
msgstr "L-unitajiet militari awtomatizzati jaġġornaw lilhom infushom meta tiflaħ."

msgid "Automated units choose promotions"
msgstr "Unitajiet awtomatizzati jistgħu jagħżlu promozzjoni"

msgid "Automated units pick their own promotions."
msgstr "Unitajiet awtomatizzati jagħżlu l-promozzjonijiet tagħhom stess."

msgid "Cities auto-bombard at end of turn"
msgstr "L-ibliet jibbumbardjaw awtomatikalment meta tlesti d-dawra tiegħek"

msgid "Cities that can still fire shoot at enemies in range when you end the turn."
msgstr "Bliet li xorta jistgħu jisparaw jisparaw fuq għedewwa fil-medda meta tispiċċa d-dawran."

msgid "Auto-assign specialists in new cities"
msgstr "Assenja awtomatikament speċjalisti fi bliet ġodda"

msgid "New cities put their citizens into specialist slots themselves."
msgstr "Bliet ġodda jpoġġu liċ-ċittadini tagħhom fi slots speċjalizzati huma stess."

msgid "Sound effects"
msgstr "Effetti tal-ħoss"

msgid "Buttons, moves, battles and the rest. In VR they come from where they happen on the table."
msgstr "Buttuni, mossi, battalji u l-bqija. Fl-VR jiġu minn fejn jiġru fuq il-mejda."

msgid "City ambience"
msgstr "L-atmosfera tal-belt"

msgid "The city noise that loops while you are in a city - Unciv has one for every era."
msgstr "L-istorbju tal-belt li jdur waqt li tkun f'belt - Unciv għandha waħda għal kull era."

msgid "Your own and mods'"
msgstr "Tiegħek u mods'"

msgid "None yet."
msgstr "Xejn għadu."

msgid "Put the panels back"
msgstr "Poġġi l-pannelli lura"

msgid "Every panel goes back to where its panel.json puts it."
msgstr "Kull panel imur lura fejn panel.json tiegħu jpoġġih."

msgid "In VR you see the controllers you're holding, as your headset's runtime draws them (SteamVR does; others get a plain stand-in)."
msgstr "Fil-VR tara l-kontrolluri li qed iżżomm, hekk kif ir-runtime tal-headset tiegħek jiġbedhom (SteamVR jagħmel; oħrajn jiksbu stand-in sempliċi)."

msgid "Boards"
msgstr "Bordijiet"

msgid "Put the boards back"
msgstr "Poġġi l-bordijiet lura"

msgid "The overview, info board, big screen, city boards, empire overview and this board go back where they started."
msgstr "Il-ħarsa ġenerali, il-bord tal-informazzjoni, il-big screen, il-bordijiet tal-belt, il-ħarsa ġenerali tal-imperu u dan il-bord imorru lura fejn bdew."

