msgid "You have %d free technologies to pick - choose a highlighted one."
msgstr "Għandek %d teknoloġiji b'xejn biex tagħżel - agħżel waħda enfasizzata."

msgid "Science %+d per turn. Picking a later tech queues its prerequisites."
msgstr "Xjenza %+d kull dawra. Picking ta 'teknoloġija aktar tard kjuwijiet prerekwiżiti tagħha."

