#: scripts/settings_board.gd
msgid "Unciv's music. Unciv comes without any: Download fetches its own track, as Unciv's button does. Put your own mp3, ogg or wav files in %s - named like Unciv's, \"<nation, tech or wonder> - <mood>\" (Ambient, Peace, War, Theme, Golden, Wonder, Researched, Victory, Defeat, Menu), they play when Unciv would play them."
msgstr "Il-mużika ta' Unciv. Unciv ma jiġix b'mużika: Niżżel iġib il-biċċa tiegħu stess, bħall-buttuna ta' Unciv. Poġġi l-fajls mp3, ogg jew wav tiegħek f'%s - imsemmija bħal ta' Unciv, \"<nazzjon, teknoloġija jew meravilja> - <burdata>\" (Ambient, Peace, War, Theme, Golden, Wonder, Researched, Victory, Defeat, Menu), u jindaqqu meta Unciv kien idoqqhom."

